P20260924DT-2089.jpg?resize=1536,1024 1536w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/P20260924DT-2089.jpg?resize=2048,1365 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 3000px) 100vw, 3000px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3000\" height=\"2000\" data-id=\"51123\" src=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/P20260924JB-1316.jpg\" alt=\"President Donald J. Trump and Chinese President Xi Jinping look at Marine One on the new helipad on the South Lawn of the White House, Thursday, September 24, 2026. (Official White House Photo by Joyce N. Boghosian)\" class=\"wp-image-51123\" srcset=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/P20260924JB-1316.jpg 3000w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/P20260924JB-1316.jpg?resize=600,400 600w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/P20260924JB-1316.jpg?resize=768,512 768w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/P20260924JB-1316.jpg?resize=1200,800 1200w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/P20260924JB-1316.jpg?resize=1536,1024 1536w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/P20260924JB-1316.jpg?resize=2048,1365 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 3000px) 100vw, 3000px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3000\" height=\"2000\" data-id=\"51116\" src=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/F20260924AH-6423.jpg\" alt=\"First Lady Melania Trump and First Lady Peng Liyuan tour the Smithsonian National Museum of Asian Art in Washington, D.C., Thursday, September 24, 2026. (Official White House Photo by Andrea Hanks)\" class=\"wp-image-51116\" srcset=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/F20260924AH-6423.jpg 3000w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/F20260924AH-6423.jpg?resize=600,400 600w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/